<title>HONG KONG: Chun Wo interim profit rises 13.36 pct.</title>
<headline>Chun Wo interim profit rises 13.36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.4	vs  7.9 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5	vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.51    vs  26.92</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,117.12 vs  634.21</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chun Wo Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 15-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Chun Wo Holdings is a construction company.</p>
<p>The comparison shares earnings figures adjusted for a bonus issue of one bonus share for every 10 shares made in September.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
